<BaseLayout title="Exhaust" description="Headers, heat, and exhaust notes for LS Genesis Coupe swaps.">
  <h1>Exhaust</h1>
  <p>
    Header choice is tied to engine mounts and steering/rack clearance. Long-tubes, mid-lengths, and turbo manifolds are all used.
  </p>
  <p>
    Sikky headers are the most commonly referenced. ISR headers sit lower and are generally not recommended on powered cars.
  </p>

